<section class="py-32 px-12 max-w-[1920px] mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-24 items-center">
<div class="space-y-8">
<h2 class="font-headline text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tighter text-on-surface">About the Project</h2>
<p class="text-xl text-on-surface-variant font-light leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
                50-MM is an experiment in visual restraint. By limiting our collective output to the standard focal length of the human eye, we eliminate the crutch of zoom and the artifice of ultra-wide angles. Every shot in this network is an honest representation of presence.
            </p>
<div class="flex gap-4">
<span class="w-12 h-[1px] bg-primary mt-3"></span>
<p class="font-label text-sm tracking-widest text-primary uppercase">Editorial standards strictly enforced</p>
</div>
</div>
